{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122370-i-need-an-idea","id":1122370,"title":"I need an idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-29T09:20:06-07:00","id":1122370,"title":"I need an idea","content":"Hi folks,<br /> <br /> I\u00b4m playing in Cologne. There you can find the Uni Center, a great skyscraper full of flats. It\u00b4s quite famous in Germany, because a famous movie was shot there in the 70s and the RAF hid one of they most famous victims there.<br /> <br /> Here is a pic: <a href=\"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uni-Center_(K%C3%B6ln\" target=\"_blank\">https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uni-Center_(K%C3%B6ln</a>)<br /> <br /> I have already a story for it, but I need the last little detail:<br /> <br /> For your info: Cologne is organized Neo-feudal. We have a Queen and under her are dukes with great power in their domaince. Under them are counts, some kind of sub management and then Barons, who control important sites or make specific tasks.<br /> <br /> For the Uni Center, I made up the story that it is in the hands of a isolated Nosferatu, who hates Vampires. He only wants to be alone. So, he got the Uni-Center as his stronghold and was elevated to Baron by the Duke. He throws every Vampire or other supernatural out who wants to go in, he himself never leaves that place. He made the block to his &quot;Oubliette&quot;.<br /> <br /> Other Vampires are jealous of this good feeding grounds and want him to share, but the Duke does not do anything.<br /> <br /> So, one day, a girl Vampire flees from someone into that building. The Nosferatu lets her in and watches her. She loves her in a way.<br /> <br /> So, the person/s who want that girl have tried for YEARS getting in there, but the Nosferatu kicks them out. <br /> <br /> So, here\u00b4s the problem: Why do they want this girl. What is the secret or the thing she has? After thinking, I came up with the following criteria:<br /> <br /> 1) It cannot be something that can be moved or owned. It must be something she knows or that is innate to her. It can\u00b4t be something she just can give away.<br /> 2) It cannot be something that the Duke of this quarter wants or has. He could throw the Nosferatu out. If the Duke would say one word, the other Vampires of this quarter would assault the Uni Center immediatly, they all want the Nosferatu out to get the feeding ground. <br /> 3) It can be, however, be something about a Duke of another Domain. It should be something really important.<br /> <br /> So what is it. The location of an elder, a terrible secret? <br /> <br /> I would be grateful when you help me.<br /> <br /> Keep on gaming,<br /> <br /> Dennis","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-30T11:10:12-07:00","id":1122746,"title":"","content":"She's the childe of someone important, the Nos knows/suspects and doesn't want any problems. The nos may be wrong about who she is and that's why no one can figure it out.<br /> The nos believes he wronged her in the past, maybe he made her a Revrent and someone else uplifted her to a diffident clan or he used her as a pawn and harmed her a lot, she doesn't know.<br /> She once saved his life, he owes her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-08T15:33:32-07:00","id":1126476,"title":"","content":"Thank you for your idea, but I wasn\u00b4t clear enough.<br /> <br /> I search for the reason the Vampire/s besieging the Uni Center wants her, not the other way around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13653-narr666","name":"Narr666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T11:14:50-07:00","id":1126779,"title":"","content":"They want the Girl Vampire because she...<ul><li>is the Childe of someone important in another City and the vampires chasing her are from there, and the local Duke is amused that someone powerful elsewhere is vexed.</li> <li>knows a secret Devotion/Blood Magic that allows her to Summon <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show?p=1099812#post1099812\">beings of hideous knowledge</a> from <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/EldritchAbomination\" target=\"_blank\">Outside-Reality</a>. The vampires are either cultists of those beings or those against its cultists. (Cultists want to Diablerize her to gain the ability, and anti-cultists want her reduced to ash to prevent that)</li> <li>knows about the vampires' mechanization to overthrow the Duke and they want to silence her.</li> <li>is the first of a new Clan and was spontaneously damned without the Embrace as was Longinus or Vlad Tepes and thus of great interest to the two related Covenants, neither of which have the Duke in their debt and the price of his intervention is more than they can afford.</li> <li>is also the object of their Obsession because she was cursed as a mortal by a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show?p=1120890#post1120890\">being</a> capable of Miracles to inspire that in all vampires that see her. (Which is how she was Embraced, readers of <i>Twilight</i> beware what you wish for) The Duke of course has never seen her. (This also explains why the Nos is acting to strange towards her)</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 08-09-2017, 02:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T13:34:40-07:00","id":1126828,"title":"","content":"Yeah thanks. I like 2) and 4) best. Maybe I find something in Half-Damned and 